# 2. Direct Business SMTP Configuration (Nodemailer - 100% Recommended)
# Works directly with your official business email info@modularagro.com
# Examples:
# - Hostinger: SMTP_HOST=smtp.hostinger.com, SMTP_PORT=465
# - Titan Mail: SMTP_HOST=smtp.titan.email, SMTP_PORT=465
# - cPanel / Custom: SMTP_HOST=mail.modularagro.com, SMTP_PORT=465
# - Google Workspace: SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com, SMTP_PORT=465 (or 587)
